# {{ name }} Accessibility

## Accessibility Support

Out of the box, the Telerik and Kendo UI {{ name }} provides extensive accessibility support and enables users with disabilities to acquire complete control over its features.

The {{ name }} is compliant with the [Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 standards](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/) and [Section 508](https://www.section508.gov/) requirements, follows the [Web Accessibility Initiative - Accessible Rich Internet Applications (WAI-ARIA)](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/) best practices{% if kbSpec and kbSpec.length %} for implementing the [keyboard navigation](#keyboard-navigation){% endif %}{% if kbSpec and kbSpec.length %} and provides options for managing its focus{% endif %} and is tested against the most popular screen readers.

